build/
# The Python tools' environment, which uv makes from uv.lock.
.venv/
# A dev container variant of the site, such as one on an internal base image, see
# .devcontainer/README.md.
/.devcontainer/vector/
# The lock file VS Code writes beside a devcontainer.json; the shared feature is local and
# has no version to pin.
/.devcontainer/*/devcontainer-lock.json
